                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "To be honest, this is a fantastic game however I extremely recommend playing solo. This game is a lot of fun, and saved my sanity sometimes in multiplayer, however there are far too many issues that can occur. Lots of spots where I've gotten stuck and literally unable to proceed with no way of getting out. So after a couple play throughs I have been extremely upset with the bugs and glitches with multiplayer and certain aspects of the game that make you restart.\n\nAdditionally, the spells are glitchy and don't always target where you want them to. \n\nIf these issues were addressed and fixed, I would be completely happy, but for now I am unable to continue my saves and am upset with the game",
